# Manufacturing QR and Barcode Scanning System

A cloud-based mobile scanning system designed for manufacturing-floor operations, production tracking, and real-time Google Sheets updates.

The system combines a lightweight mobile web interface with a Google Cloud Run backend and queue-based spreadsheet processing.

```text
QR Master
    ↓
Open Mobile Scanning UI
    ↓
Resolve Spreadsheet and PXK Context
    ↓
Scan Product Barcode
    ↓
Validate Manufacturing Workflow Step
    ↓
Submit Request to Cloud Run API
    ↓
Write Request to Google Sheets Queue
    ↓
Process Manufacturing Update
    ↓
Return OK, SKIP, or ERROR Status
